      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/45deac/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2011-11-30T21:09:09.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You should include these in the expansion box!  I recently got the expansion to Space Alert and they had an achievement system too.  It really added to the game and not many board games have achievements - something else to set this game apart as something greater!  Have you ever thought of doing a leveling system that carries over from game to game?  you could get extra points for doing the story challenges!!</p>",
